      "provenance": "admission-addendum-20261017",
      "note": "SIGIR 2026, DOI 10.1145/3805712.3809719. Atomic <item_N> tokens, one added tokenizer token per item (data.py, BSRDataset); constrained-decoding trie over these tokens; no RQ-VAE/quantization/clustering/SID construction. Fails core invariants 1, 3, and 4. Official code public at HEAD bc5de60 (2026-08-31), no LICENSE file (spdx_id null): research-evaluation use only, no vendoring. Boundary fact: atomic IDs plus gradient-subspace tuning beat the TIGER/LETTER/Sem-BSR/GenSAR semantic-ID baselines on Qilin and Amazon in their tables."
    },
